      "user_id": "u-mei",
      "text": "Someone put a two storey snowman in the E7 atrium and the grads hung banners down the whole height of it. Best the building has ever looked.",
      "image_url": "/seed/e7-grad-decorations.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:uw-northwest-campus",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-043",
      "user_id": "u-sarah",
      "text": "Window on the ground floor of E7 is cracked right through. Taped up for now.",
      "image_url": "/seed/e7-window-broken.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T09:10:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:uw-northwest-campus",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-044",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "Three trucks outside 58 Cardill for twenty minutes. Turned out to be a false alarm, everyone is back inside.",
      "image_url": "/seed/cardill-false-alarm.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T18:45:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:uw-northwest-campus",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-045",
      "user_id": "u-aisha",
      "text": "Flew over the Environmental Reserve at golden hour. Ponds, fields and the whole north end glowing. Hard to believe this is ten minutes from campus.",
      "image_url": "/seed/environmental-reserve.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T19:30:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:uw-research-and-technology-park",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-046",
      "user_id": "u-sarah",
      "text": "Whole park from the air. Silver Lake, the boardwalk, and Uptown right behind it.",
      "image_url": "/seed/waterloo-park-aerial.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T17:05:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:central",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-047",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "Hoarding still up around the Public Square platform. Track is in, the shelter is half clad, and you walk the long way round for now.",
      "image_url": "/seed/uptown-public-square.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T08:40:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:central",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-050",
      "user_id": "u-mei",
      "text": "Everyone on the bridge stopped walking. The whole sky went black over campus with one orange strip left under it. Half the crowd had phones up.",
      "image_url": "/seed/e7-storm-cloud.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T19:50:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:uw-northwest-campus",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-051",
      "user_id": "u-dev",
      "text": "Stands are full for the new students. Purple lights, leaders in white shirts down the front, and it is very loud in here.",
      "image_url": "/seed/new-student-ceremony.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:25:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:uw-northwest-campus",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-052",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "First walk back past the library. Same concrete, same arches, clear sky, nobody around yet.",
      "image_url": "/seed/back-to-uw.jpg",
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T18:10:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:uw-northwest-campus",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-053",
      "user_id": "u-jordan",
      "text": "Crossing guard on Westmount knows every kid by name. Small thing, makes the morning.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:westmount",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-054",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "Hydro crew has been up the pole outside since seven. Whole street is out watching.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:westmount",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-055",
      "user_id": "u-dev",
      "text": "Leaves are down early this year. The strip is already gold.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:westmount",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-056",
      "user_id": "u-mei",
      "text": "Pool is open late all week and the parking lot is full by six.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:beechwood",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-057",
      "user_id": "u-sarah",
      "text": "Somebody's put a little free library at the end of the crescent. Half of it is cookbooks.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:beechwood",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-058",
      "user_id": "u-aisha",
      "text": "Quietest street in the city until the school bus turns the corner.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:beechwood",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-059",
      "user_id": "u-tomas",
      "text": "New trail link opened behind the subdivision. Cuts ten minutes off the walk to the plaza.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:clair-hills",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-060",
      "user_id": "u-jordan",
      "text": "Coyote at the treeline again last night. Nobody is walking the dog off leash now.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:clair-hills",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-061",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "Every house on this street has the same lamp post and I find it oddly comforting.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:clair-hills",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-062",
      "user_id": "u-yuki",
      "text": "Plaza parking is a demolition derby on a Saturday and I say that with affection.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:northland",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-063",
      "user_id": "u-mei",
      "text": "Snow came off the roofs all at once this afternoon. Sounded like the building fell over.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:northland",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-064",
      "user_id": "u-sarah",
      "text": "Bus shelter finally got its glass back.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:northland",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-065",
      "user_id": "u-dev",
      "text": "Mall lot at nine on a weeknight is the emptiest place in Waterloo.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:conestoga",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-066",
      "user_id": "u-tomas",
      "text": "Line out the door at the bakery and not one person complaining.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:conestoga",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-067",
      "user_id": "u-jordan",
      "text": "They have started the holiday lights already. It is not even cold yet.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:conestoga",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-068",
      "user_id": "u-aisha",
      "text": "Sledding hill is officially open, verified by every child in a two block radius.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:west-hill",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-069",
      "user_id": "u-yuki",
      "text": "Recycling truck came at 6am and I have opinions.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:west-hill",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-070",
      "user_id": "u-mei",
      "text": "Sunset from the top of the rise is worth the walk up.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:west-hill",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-071",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "Community garden plots all planted out. Someone is growing corn, which feels ambitious.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:willowdale",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-072",
      "user_id": "u-dev",
      "text": "Kids have built an entire fort in the ravine and it is structurally better than my shelving.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:willowdale",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-073",
      "user_id": "u-tomas",
      "text": "Power flickered twice tonight but held.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:willowdale",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-074",
      "user_id": "u-sarah",
      "text": "Rink is flooded and frozen. First skate of the year tomorrow.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:dearborn",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-075",
      "user_id": "u-aisha",
      "text": "Three garage sales on one street. I came home with a lamp I do not need.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:dearborn",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-076",
      "user_id": "u-yuki",
      "text": "The trail behind the school floods every spring and every spring we are surprised.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:dearborn",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-077",
      "user_id": "u-jordan",
      "text": "Traffic on the connector is a mess since the lights changed.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:lexington",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-078",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "Found a whole flock of turkeys in the field by the plaza. They had right of way.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:lexington",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-079",
      "user_id": "u-dev",
      "text": "New sidewalk finally joins up. You can walk the whole way now.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:lexington",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-080",
      "user_id": "u-mei",
      "text": "Tennis courts are booked solid every evening until dark.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:beechwood-west",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-081",
      "user_id": "u-sarah",
      "text": "Someone mows a spiral into the boulevard grass every summer. Never found out who.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:beechwood-west",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-082",
      "user_id": "u-aisha",
      "text": "Quiet enough here that you can hear the ION horn from the other side of the city.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:beechwood-west",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-083",
      "user_id": "u-tomas",
      "text": "Boardwalk over the wetland is finally repaired. Herons unimpressed.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:eastbridge",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-084",
      "user_id": "u-jordan",
      "text": "School field is a swamp after that rain but the game went ahead anyway.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:eastbridge",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-085",
      "user_id": "u-omar",
      "text": "Half the street is out with wheelbarrows. Mulch delivery day.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:eastbridge",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-086",
      "user_id": "u-yuki",
      "text": "Walked the whole loop around the lake before the sun was properly up.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T9:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:lakeshore",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-087",
      "user_id": "u-mei",
      "text": "Geese have taken the path again. You do not argue with them, you go around.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-18T12:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:lakeshore",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p-088",
      "user_id": "u-sarah",
      "text": "Canoe out on the water at seven and not another person in sight.",
      "image_url": null,
      "lon": 0,
      "lat": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:20:00-04:00",
      "community_id": "kw:lakeshore",
      "is_incident_report": false,
      "status": "analyzed",
      "hidden": false,
      "hidden_reason": null
    }
  ]
